cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cello in a project, cite this software release."
title: "Cello: Biochemical Cell Simulator"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bitar
    given-names: Abdsalam
version: 1.8.0
date-released: 2026-09-19
license: LicenseRef-Proprietary
abstract: >-
  Cello is an interactive biochemical cell simulator and research-oriented
  visualization platform for Windows x64. Version 1.8.0 adds reproducible
  experiment automation for model-parameter and microenvironment condition
  matrices while retaining population simulation, quantitative analysis,
  perturbation workflows, pathway exploration, and the Microenvironment Engine.
keywords:
  - biochemistry
  - cell simulation
  - systems biology
  - scientific visualization
  - computational biology
  - experiment automation
  - parameter sweep
  - microenvironment
